{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 18, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark noble traveler to Nippon’s fair domain\nWhere cherry blossoms weep in gentle rain\nLet thy sojourn be thus chronicled in rhyme\nA grand adventure through time and clime.\n\n**Day the First**\nAwake ere dawns first golden light\nTo Tokyo’s bustle take thy flight.\nBy Shibuya’s crossroads stand thou still\nWhere dreams and neon lights do twill.\nTo Shinjuku’s heart then make thy way\nThrough streets where old doth meet new fray.\nAt Meiji’s shrine with reverence pray\nAnd offerings cast to gods of gray.\nThrough Ginza’s lanes with merchants trade\nWhere silk and gold in splendor glade.\n\n**Day the Second**\nTo Asakusa’s temple gates repair\nWhere lanterns glow through night and air.\nAt Senso-ji’s hall kneel low\nAnd prayers to Buddhas soft bestow.\nOn Sumida’s river take thy seat\nA cruise ‘neath Tokyo’s sweet retreat.\nBy dusk do return to neons bright\nWhere izakayas call thou night.\n\n**Day the Third**\nArise swift take the train’s swift course\nTo Kyoto’s grace and ancient force.\nAt Kiyomizu’s temple stand\nWhere wooden stages over land.\nThrough Philosopher’s Path meander\nWhere plum and maple shadows dance and tangle\nAt Arashiyama’s bamboo grove remain\nWhere whispers of wind through leaves contain.\nIn Gion’s quarter at dusk’s soft hue\nGeisha’s shadows dance in view.\n\n**Day the Fourth**\nTo Nara’s plains where deer do roam\nWith crackers of rice in hand bestow\nAt Todai-ji’s hall stand tall\nBefore Buddha’s gaze so hallowed.\nThrough Nara Park where time doth stall\nReturn to Kyoto’s twilight glow.\nAt Pontocho’s alleyways take thy fill\nOf kaiseki feasts and sake’s sweet thrill.\n\n**Day the Fifth**\nTo Osaka’s castle walls repair\nWhere history and commerce share.\nAt Dotonbori’s lights so bold\nTakoyaki’s crisp delights unfold.\nThrough Universal Studios’ realm take flight\nWhere samurai and dragons burn with might.\n\n**Day the Sixth**\nTo Hiroshima’s shrine of peace repair\nWhere souls lost in war do forever linger\nAt Miyajima’s floating torii stand\nWhere tides and temples hand in hand.\nThrough Itsukushima’s hallowed air\nReturn to Osaka’s bustling care.\n\n**Day the Seventh**\nBack to Tokyo’s heart now bound\nWhere last thy journey’s tale be found.\nAt Tsukiji’s market fresh delights explore\nThen Akihabara’s lights no more ignore.\nThrough Odaiba’s future gaze\nWhere rainbows bridge and dreams ablaze.\nOn final night with heart so light\nIn Shinjuku’s glow thy journey’s sight.\n\nFare thee well dear traveler bold\nThrough Japan’s land both old and new\nWith stories told and memories stowed\nMay thy adventures e’er be loved.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.16029712557792664}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.0027155925054103136}, {"token": " noble", "logprob": -2.659248113632202}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -0.28536224365234375}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0002506657037883997}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -2.1297554969787598}, {"token": " Nippon", "logprob": -2.148405075073242}, {"token": "’s", "logprob": -0.4578436613082886}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.20111213624477386}, {"token": " domain", "logprob": -1.9565073251724243}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.20694701373577118}, {"token": "Where", "logprob": -0.9218570590019226}, {"token": " cherry", "logprob": -0.1632455289363861}, {"token": " bloss", "logprob": -0.18009497225284576}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -0.005332057364284992}, {"token": " we", "logprob": -2.409423351287842}, {"token": "ep", "logprob": -0.015373656526207924}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -1.160293698310852}, {"token": " gentle", "logprob": -2.4935829639434814}, {"token": " rain", "logprob": -0.012838800437748432}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.06899217516183853}, {"token": "Let", "logprob": -1.4466925859451294}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -2.156672477722168}, {"token": " so", "logprob": -1.8708359003067017}, {"token": "journ", "